that any attempt to merge them would basically rob each of them of whatever kind of a attraction they might have for their constituency. I went on in these terms for a while. Michael Beirut had a big challenge on his hands, advertising a furniture show and a lecture about designing for outer space on the same invitation. Ultimately, he came up with an inspired way to solve the problem. He would make the invitation reversible. I just like drew on a piece of paper a little drawing that if you looked at it one way,
